 rolls out faster, easier way to report customer concerns online\nOfficial site of the Philippines' leading telecommunications and digital services provider\nThis is part of our commitment to elevate the quality of service that we deliver to our customers through technology and innovation. This is an assurance to our customers that we are here to help,” said Jeanine Rubin, FVP and Head, Customer Experience Group at PLDT. PLDT Home customers using this feature is as easy as 1,2,3:\nGo to https://pldthome.com/support","type":"semt"},{"score":0.0022386669,"si":1,"text":"One click away: PLDT rolls out faster, easier way to report customer concerns online\nOfficial site of the Philippines' leading telecommunications and digital services provider\nWith this new digital solution, customers no longer need to call the hotline, queue in physical stores, or wait for a response on social media. With just a few clicks, customers can easily inquire about their bills, request for aftersales support, file complaints, or report service issues through this easy-to-understand feature of PLDT Home’s Support website.","type":"semt"},{"score":0.002207488,"si":6,"text":"One click away: PLDT rolls out faster, easier way to report customer concerns online\nOfficial site of the Philippines' leading telecommunications and digital services provider\npartner with Capillary to unify loyalty programs Oct 5, 2026 News PLDT Global executive urges culture-first leadership in Hong Kong business forum Oct 2, 2026 LATEST ARTICLES News Subsea cables are critical infra requiring whole-of-nation protection – PLDT Oct 14, 2026 Malasakit (ESG) PLDT, Smart and Unilab Foundation bring crisis-tested learning program to more Philippine schools","type":"semt"},{"score":0.0022016442,"si":0,"text":"One click away: PLDT rolls out faster, easier way to report customer concerns online\nOfficial site of the Philippines' leading telecommunications and digital services provider\nNews\nOne click away: PLDT rolls out faster, easier way to report customer concerns online\nSep 20, 2022\nPLDT Inc. customers now have a faster and easier way to request for support or to report service issues with the improved PLDT Home Support Page (www.pldthome.com/support).","type":"semt"},{"score":0.0021942595,"si":2,"text":"One click away: PLDT rolls out faster, easier way to report customer concerns online\nOfficial site of the Philippines' leading telecommunications and digital services provider\nCustomers also receive a confirmation email and regular status updates with guaranteed faster resolution. “Through this new self-service channel, we hope to provide our customers with faster, easier, and more convenient ways to get help for their concerns without having to call the hotline or wait in line in our physical stores.","type":"semt"},{"score":0.0021550998,"si":7,"text":"One click away: PLDT rolls out faster, easier way to report customer concerns online\nOfficial site of the Philippines' leading telecommunications and digital services provider\nOct 13, 2026 News PLDT Global and Smart extend support to Filipinos in Saudi Arabia amid ongoing incident Oct 13, 2026 News PLDT Group’s ERICA Wins 2026 AIBP Enterprise Innovation Award for Data and AI Oct 9, 2026","type":"semt"}],"_x":{"a":1,"at":1792049594112,"au":"System","cts":1792043917354,"df":0,"op":1,"sbc":"PLDTRPAI_WEB_DLFTHNSX","srcId":2110611281189982211,"uts":1792049594112,"v":0},"content":"News\nOne click away: PLDT rolls out faster, easier way to report customer concerns online\nSep 20, 2022\nPLDT Inc. customers now have a faster and easier way to request for support or to report service issues with the improved PLDT Home Support Page (www.pldthome.com/support). With this new digital solution, customers no longer need to call the hotline, queue in physical stores, or wait for a response on social media.\nWith just a few clicks, customers can easily inquire about their bills, request for aftersales support, file complaints, or report service issues through this easy-to-understand feature of PLDT Home’s Support website. Customers also receive a confirmation email and regular status updates with guaranteed faster resolution.\n“Through this new self-service channel, we hope to provide our customers with faster, easier, and more convenient ways to get help for their concerns without having to call the hotline or wait in line in our physical stores. This is part of our commitment to elevate the quality of service that we deliver to our customers through technology and innovation. This is an assurance to our customers that we are here to help,” said Jeanine Rubin, FVP and Head, Customer Experience Group at PLDT.\nPLDT Home customers using this feature is as easy as 1,2,3:\nGo to https://pldthome.com/support\nChoose a service (Track Status, Pay Bill, Clarify Bill Charges, Make an Aftersales Request, Report a Contractor, Report a Service Issue)\nFollow the instructions and done!\nFor more information, visit pldthome.com/support.\nRELATED ARTICLES\nNews\nSubsea cables are critical infra requiring whole-of-nation protection – PLDT\nOct 14, 2026\nNews\nPLDT Global and Smart extend support to Filipinos in Saudi Arabia amid ongoing incident\nOct 13, 2026\nNews\nPLDT Group’s ERICA Wins 2026 AIBP Enterprise Innovation Award for Data and AI\nOct 9, 2026\nNews\nPLDT and Smart partner with Capillary to unify loyalty programs\nOct 5, 2026\nNews\nPLDT Global executive urges culture-first leadership in Hong Kong business forum\nOct 2, 2026\nLATEST ARTICLES\nNews\nSubsea cables are critical infra requiring whole-of-nation protection – PLDT\nOct 14, 2026\nMalasakit (ESG)\nPLDT, Smart and Unilab Foundation bring crisis-tested learning program to more Philippine schools\nOct 13, 2026\nNews\nPLDT Global and Smart extend support to Filipinos in Saudi Arabia amid ongoing incident\nOct 13, 2026\nNews\nPLDT Group’s ERICA Wins 2026 AIBP Enterprise Innovation Award for Data and AI\nOct 9, 2026","domain":"main.pldt.com","id":2110626011644297216,"post_ts":1663603200000,"ss":[{"chunk_id":0,"content":"News\nOne click away: PLDT rolls out faster, easier way to report customer concerns online\nSep 20, 2022\nPLDT Inc. customers now have a faster and easier way to request for support or to report service issues with the improved PLDT Home Support Page (www.pldthome.com/support).","ctx":{"span":[0,274]}},{"chunk_id":1,"content":"With this new digital solution, customers no longer need to call the hotline, queue in physical stores, or wait for a response on social media. With just a few clicks, customers can easily inquire about their bills, request for aftersales support, file complaints, or report service issues through this easy-to-understand feature of PLDT Home’s Support website.","ctx":{"span":[0,360]}},{"chunk_id":2,"content":"Customers also receive a confirmation email and regular status updates with guaranteed faster resolution. “Through this new self-service channel, we hope to provide our customers with faster, easier, and more convenient ways to get help for their concerns without having to call the hotline or wait in line in our physical stores.","ctx":{"span":[0,329]}},{"chunk_id":3,"content":"This is part of our commitment to elevate the quality of service that we deliver to our customers through technology and innovation. This is an assurance to our customers that we are here to help,” said Jeanine Rubin, FVP and Head, Customer Experience Group at PLDT. PLDT Home customers using this feature is as easy as 1,2,3:\nGo to https://pldthome.com/support","ctx":{"span":[0,360]}},{"chunk_id":4,"content":"Choose a service (Track Status, Pay Bill, Clarify Bill Charges, Make an Aftersales Request, Report a Contractor, Report a Service Issue)\nFollow the instructions and done! For more information, visit pldthome.com/support.","ctx":{"span":[0,219]}},{"chunk_id":5,"content":"For more information, visit pldthome.com/support. RELATED ARTICLES News Subsea cables are critical infra requiring whole-of-nation protection – PLDT Oct 14, 2026 News PLDT Global and Smart extend support to Filipinos in Saudi Arabia amid ongoing incident Oct 13, 2026 News PLDT Group’s ERICA Wins 2026 AIBP Enterprise Innovation Award for Data and AI Oct 9, 2026 News PLDT and Smart","ctx":{"span":[0,381]}},{"chunk_id":6,"content":"partner with Capillary to unify loyalty programs Oct 5, 2026 News PLDT Global executive urges culture-first leadership in Hong Kong business forum Oct 2, 2026 LATEST ARTICLES News Subsea cables are critical infra requiring whole-of-nation protection – PLDT Oct 14, 2026 Malasakit (ESG) PLDT, Smart and Unilab Foundation bring crisis-tested learning program to more Philippine schools","ctx":{"span":[0,382]}},{"chunk_id":7,"content":"Oct 13, 2026 News PLDT Global and Smart extend support to Filipinos in Saudi Arabia amid ongoing incident Oct 13, 2026 News PLDT Group’s ERICA Wins 2026 AIBP Enterprise Innovation Award for Data and AI Oct 9, 2026","ctx":{"span":[0,212]}}],"summary":"Official site of the Philippines' leading telecommunications and digital services provider","title":"One click away: PLDT rolls out faster, easier way to report customer concerns online","url":"https://main.pldt.com/article/one-click-away-pldt-rolls-out-faster-easier-way-report-customer-concerns-online"}]}]}}}
